><section id="looking-for-a-peru-courier-service?-look-no-further" class="section-wrapper" index="1" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJJZbqstJ9-Tfw_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2847.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer stood outside of a ParcelShop store smiling and holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront." width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Looking for a Peru courier service? Look no further</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Over a century ago, the world marvelled at the discovery of ancient civilisations; today, diligent couriers navigate Peru&#39;s vibrant city streets, ensuring parcels reach their destinations safely and securely. From Lima to Arequipa and beyond, our fast and reliable service covers the entirety of Peru. Drop off at a ParcelShop or Locker today to get your parcel on the move.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The countries in South America are as vibrant as they are vast. Thankfully, international coverage is one of our specialities.<!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/ecuador" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send a parcel to Ecuador<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or book a <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/panama" class=""><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->delivery to Panama<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for fast and reliable service.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="how-much-does-it-cost-to-send-a-parcel-to-peru?" class="pricing-table" index="2" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__container" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="pricing-table__content" data-v-ae5ccddd><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-ae5ccddd data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--rightmost-col-blue reusable-table__table--header-row-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Parcel weight</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Prices from</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>With SAVEON£30</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Savings</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>250g</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£22.19</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>-</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>-</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>500g</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£23.39</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>-</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>-</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£25.89</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>-</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>-</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>2kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£30.69</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£28.94</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£1.75</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>5kg</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£47.99</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£45.25</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>£2.74</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="pricing-table__description" data-v-ae5ccddd>Prices quoted are ‘starting from’ and may change based on the volumetric weight of a parcel. SAVEON£30 discount applies only to orders over £30; discounted prices above are per parcel.</p></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section" data-v-ae5ccddd><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+(1).svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Send" width="88" height="24" class="pricing-table__save-section-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-ae5ccddd><h2 class="pricing-table__save-section-title" data-v-ae5ccddd>How much does it cost to send a parcel to Peru?</h2><div class="pricing-table__save-section-subheader" data-v-ae5ccddd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sending a parcel to Peru is cheaper than you might think with Evri. We deliver packages up to 15kg all over the world, fully tracked and with £20 parcel cover included for no extra cost. If you use code <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->SAVEON£30 <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->at checkout, you can even get a discount on orders over £30.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="pricing-table__save-section-buttons-container" data-v-ae5ccddd><!----><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link pricing-table__save-section-button" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-send" data-v-ae5ccddd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Send a parcel to Peru<!--]--></span></a></div></div></div></section><section id="section_component" class="section" index="3" data-v-997ea6a1><div data-v-997ea6a1><h2 class="section__title" data-v-997ea6a1></h2><div class="section__text" data-v-997ea6a1><!--v-if--></div></div></section><section id="public-holidays-in-peru-that-could-affect-shipping-times" class="section-wrapper" index="4" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Public holidays in Peru that could affect shipping times</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A public holiday in Peru could cause a potential delay in your parcel’s delivery time, so it’s important to be aware of them. We would always recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->New Year&#39;s Day <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 01/01/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Maundy Thursday <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 02/04/2026 <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Good Friday <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 03/04/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Labour Day<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 01/05/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Feast of St Peter and St Paul<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 29/06/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Air Force Day <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 23/07/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Independence Day <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 28/07/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Independence Day Holiday <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 29/07/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Battle of Junín <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 06/08/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Santa Rosa de Lima <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 30/08/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Battle of Angamos <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 08/10/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->All Saints&#39; Day <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 01/11/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Immaculate Conception <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->- 08/12/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Battle of Ayacucho<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 09/12/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Christmas Day<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> - 25/12/2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="send-to-peru-in-one-of-three-easy-ways-" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Send to Peru in one of three easy ways <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our expansive network of ParcelShops and Lockers has made dropping off a parcel easier than ever. Not to mention our incredible couriers who are out collecting straight from our customers&#39; doorsteps. Read more about the ways you can send to Peru:  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With 9,000+ ParcelShops located across the country, you’re never too far from an easy drop off. Receive assistance from our wonderful ParcelShop partners who can assist you with printing your parcel and getting it on the move.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find your local ParcelShop-open Find your local ParcelShop page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find your local ParcelShop<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At the cutting edge of automated parcel drop off, our Lockers are making life easy for Evri customers all over the UK. Did you know all our Lockers are now equipped with label printers free of charge? Head down today.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Locate your nearest Locker-open Locate your nearest Locker page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Locate your nearest Locker<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier handing a customer a blue slip to confirm the details of a doorstep parcel collection. The transaction is taking place in a block of flats" width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Couriers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Running short on time? Parcel drop off doesn’t have to be a hassle – let one of our couriers take care of it! Book a courier collection today and get a 1-hour window to know when to expect them. Choose convenience with courier collection.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Book a courier collection today-open Book a courier collection today page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Book a courier collection today<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="customs-made-simple-with-evri" class="section-wrapper" index="6" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10821bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10821.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10821.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10821.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An older couple, a man and a woman, are sat on a sofa. They are laughing whilst using a laptop." width="1000" height="665" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Customs made simple with Evri</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you’re worried about customs forms and admin, don’t be! At Evri, we take care of all the paperwork for you by processing it all in the background using the information you provide when you make the booking. We even have a lookup function for HS codes, so just tell us what’s in the box and we’ll fill that part in for you. Sending a parcel internationally should be stress-free, so make it easy by sending with Evri today.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Send a parcel to Peru" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-send" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-