iv></section><section id="frequently-asked-questions" class="faqs" index="11" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>Frequently asked questions</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoperu-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoperu" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoperu" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How long does it take to send a parcel to Peru?-open answer" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoperu-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoperu-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How long does it take to send a parcel to Peru?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoperu" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoperu" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howlongdoesittaketosendaparceltoperu-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A parcel to Peru, once dropped off at a ParcelShop or Locker, should take around 18-21 days to arrive at its destination. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcelstoperu-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-canitrackmyparcelstoperu" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-canitrackmyparcelstoperu" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I track my parcels to Peru?-open answer" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcelstoperu-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcelstoperu-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I track my parcels to Peru?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-canitrackmyparcelstoperu" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-canitrackmyparcelstoperu" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canitrackmyparcelstoperu-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Absolutely. We offer end-to-end tracking on all our parcels for no additional cost. Simply input your tracking number on our <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/track-a-parcel" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->international tracking page<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->,<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and you’ll be able to see your parcel’s progress.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="arethereanyimporttaxestopayonaparcelfromtheuktoperu-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-arethereanyimporttaxestopayonaparcelfromtheuktoperu" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-arethereanyimporttaxestopayonaparcelfromtheuktoperu" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Are there any import taxes to pay on a parcel from the UK to Peru?-open answer" data-test-id="arethereanyimporttaxestopayonaparcelfromtheuktoperu-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="arethereanyimporttaxestopayonaparcelfromtheuktoperu-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Are there any import taxes to pay on a parcel from the UK to Peru?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-arethereanyimporttaxestopayonaparcelfromtheuktoperu" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-arethereanyimporttaxestopayonaparcelfromtheuktoperu" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="arethereanyimporttaxestopayonaparcelfromtheuktoperu-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->When sending parcels to Peru, you may need to pay customs fees and taxes. The average import tax on goods entering Peru is 18% but the amount can vary depending on the destination, purpose, and value of your parcel. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your recipient needs to pay customs duty, remember to let them know. We’ll contact your recipient and share a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Check out our simple guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/how-to-send-an-international-parcel" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->how to send an international parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> for more information. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAM