checkout, you can even get a discount on orders over £30.  ",[159],{"start":160,"end":161,"type":99},203,213,{"link_type":36,"key":163,"url":164},"96a7e95e-c5af-4939-98e3-717e165e53ea","peru.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send",{"link_type":166},"Any","Prices quoted are ‘starting from’ and may change based on the volumetric weight of a parcel. SAVEON£30 discount applies only to orders over £30; discounted prices above are per parcel.",true,"Parcel weight","Prices from","With SAVEON£30","Savings","pricing_table_v2$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":128,"version":31,"items":176,"primary":177,"id":179,"slice_type":180,"slice_label":46},[],{"SectionHeader":46,"SectionText":178},[],"section_component$40cc67f6-a8e2-4b6e-a4c3-cd89b51019b4","section_component",{"variation":182,"version":31,"items":183,"primary":185,"id":265,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[184],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":186,"CardText":187,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":264,"IsEco":20},"Public holidays in Peru that could affect shipping times",[188,191,197,202,207,212,217,222,227,232,236,241,246,250,255,259],{"type":89,"text":189,"spans":190,"direction":92},"A public holiday in Peru could cause a potential delay in your parcel’s delivery time, so it’s important to be aware of them. We would always recommend sending your parcel earlier to increase your chances of arriving on time. ",[],{"type":192,"text":193,"spans":194,"direction":92},"list-item","New Year's Day - 01\u002F01\u002F2026",[195],{"start":66,"end":196,"type":99},15,{"type":192,"text":198,"spans":199,"direction":92},"Maundy Thursday - 02\u002F04\u002F2026 ",[200],{"start":66,"end":201,"type":99},16,{"type":192,"text":203,"spans":204,"direction":92},"Good Friday - 03\u002F04\u002F2026",[205],{"start":66,"end":206,"type":99},12,{"type":192,"text":208,"spans":209,"direction":92},"Labour Day - 01\u002F05\u002F2026",[210],{"start":66,"end":211,"type":99},10,{"type":192,"text