92},"With 9,000+ ParcelShops located across the country, you’re never too far from an easy drop off. Receive assistance from our wonderful ParcelShop partners who can assist you with printing your parcel and getting it on the move.  ",[],{"dimensions":280,"alt":281,"copyright":46,"url":282,"id":283,"edit":284},{"width":78,"height":79},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","peru.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":66,"y":84,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":36,"key":287,"url":288},"1cca406f-27ae-4d09-8f22-677c1b65d1d7","\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":166},{"Title":291,"Description":295,"Image":299,"Label":46,"UrlText":305,"Url":306,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":308,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[292],{"type":272,"text":293,"spans":294},"Lockers",[],[296],{"type":89,"text":297,"spans":298,"direction":92},"At the cutting edge of automated parcel drop off, our Lockers are making life easy for Evri customers all over the UK. Did you know all our Lockers are now equipped with label printers free of charge? Head down today.  ",[],{"dimensions":300,"alt":301,"copyright":46,"url":302,"id":303,"edit":304},{"width":78,"height":79},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","peru.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":66,"y":84,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Locate your nearest Locker",{"link_type":36,"key":307,"url":288},"f1e23d2a-766b-443a-95a6-62e084df1b68",{"link_type":166},{"Title":310,"Description":314,"Image":318,"Label":46,"UrlText":324,"Url":325,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":328,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[311],{"type":272,"text":312,"spans":313},"Couriers",[],[315],{"type":89,"text":316,"spans":317,"direction":92},"Running short on time? Parcel drop off doesn’t have to be a hassle – let one of our couriers take care of it! Book a courier collection today and get a 1-hour window to know when to expect them. Choose convenience with courier collection.",[],{"dimensions":319,"alt":320,"copyright":46,"url":321,"id":322,"edit":323},{"width":78,"height":79},"An Evri Courier handing a customer a blue slip to confirm the details of a doorstep parcel collection. The transaction is taking place in a block of flats","peru.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4535.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69x-ZbqstJ9-pVM",{"x":66,"y":84,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Book a courier collection today",{"link_type":36,"key":326,"url":327},"f980a8e2-e519-489e-acfb-954b3235624e","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":166},{"SectionTitle":330,"SectionDescription":335,"theme":46},[331],{"type":332,"text":333,"spans":334,"direction":92},"heading2","Send to Peru in one of three easy ways ",[],[336],{"type":89,"text":337,"spans":338,"direction":92},"Our expansive network of ParcelShops and Lockers has made dropping off a parcel easier than ever. Not to mention our incredible couriers who are out collecting straight from our customers' doorsteps. Read more about the ways you can send to Peru:  ",[],"article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":128,"version":31,"items":342,"primary":343,"id":357,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":46},[],{"CardImage":344,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":350,"CardText":351,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":355,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":345,"alt":346,"copyright":46,"url":347,"id":348,"edit":349},{"width":78,"height":79},"An older couple, a man and a woman, are sat on a sofa. They are laughing whilst using a laptop.","peru.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10821.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7",{"x":66,"y":84,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Customs made simple with Evri",[352],{"type":89,"text":353,"spans":354,"direction":92},"If you’re worried about customs forms and admin, don’t be! At Evri, we take care of all the paperwork for you by processing it all in the background using the information you provide when you make the booking. We even have a lookup function for HS codes, so just tell us what’s in the box and we’ll fill that part in for you. Sending a parcel internationally should be stress-free, so make it easy by sending with Evri today.  ",[],{"link_type":36,"key":356,"url":164},"b98f3e26-75c2-4f87-8f65-31d4469f6d02","card$c1d3910c-7ce1-4347-9ab5-34e40a08b7bb",{"variation":128,"version":31,"items":359,"primary":361,"id":403,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":46},[360],{},{"CardImage":362,"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":369,"CardText":370,"ButtonText":400,"ButtonUrl":401,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":363,"alt":365,"copyright":46,"url":366,"id":367,"edit":368},{"width":78,"height":364},667,"Business owner sat at a desk in their home office using their laptop to book multiple parcels","peru.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8377.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2zpbqstJ9-SQQ",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Send multiple parcels to Peru with ease",[371,374,378,381,397],{"type":89,"text":372,"spans":373,"direction":92},"If you’re an online seller looking to send a few parcels to Peru in one go, then we’ve got the solution for you. Between our marketplace integrations and CSV upload capabilities, you can book as many parcels as you want in just a few short steps:",[],{"type":375,"text":376,"spans":377,"direction":92},"o-list-item","Link your Evri account with your marketplace seller’s account or upload your parcels using a CSV file ",[],{"type":375,"text":379,"spans":380,"direction":92},"Package up your items and book your parcels all at once ",[],{"type":375,"text":382,"spans":383,"direction":92},"Print off your postage labels at home or at a ParcelShop using a Print in ParcelShop device ",[384,395],{"start":385,"end":386,"type":102,"data":387},65,92,{"id":388,"type":105,"tags":389,"lang":15,"slug":390,"first_publication_date":391,"last_publication_date":392,"uid":393,"url":394,"link_type":18,"isBroken":20},"YhadqhIAACsA0rN4",[273],"print-in-parcelshop--print-parcel-labels--evri","2022-02-23T21:16:27+0000","2026-03-18T09:48:59+0000","print-in-parcelshop","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop",{"start":385,"end":396,"type":99},91,{"type":375,"text":398,"spans":399,"direction":92},"Send your parcels using any of our 10,000+ drop off locations across the country or let your courier make a collection. ",[],"Send multiple parcels to Peru",{"link_type":36,"key":402,"url":38},"e6974bb4-4ba1-4fc3-9fcf-26c634ea06e8","card$93d4bb75-307c-477d-b60c-f6458e923fd2",{"variation":405,"version":31,"items":406,"primary":488,"id":491,"slice_type":492,"slice_label":46},"listComponent",[407,427,439,451,464,476],{"title":408,"content":409,"icon":420},"Regular tracking updates",[410],{"type":89,"text":411,"spans":412,"direction":92},"Keep updated on your parcel's progress with end-to-end tracking and notifications for you and your recipient at no extra cost",[413,419],{"start":414,"end":415,"type":102,"data":416},55,63,{"link_type":36,"url":417,"target":418},"\u002Ftrack-a-parcel","_blank",{"start":414,"end":415,"type":99},{"dimensions":421,"alt":423,"copyright":46,"url":424,"id":425,"edit":426},{"width":422,"height":422},40,"Phone icon","peru.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":428,"content":429,"icon":433},"Parcel cover",[430],{"type":89,"text":431,"spans":432,"direction":92},"Every parcel you send includes £20 free cover. If your item’s worth more, you can easily increase the cover up to £999 for extra peace of mind!",[],{"dimensions":434,"alt":435,"copyright":46,"url":436,"id":437,"edit":438},{"width":422,"height":422},"Money icon","peru.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":440,"content":441,"icon":445},"Customs made easier",[442],{"type":89,"text":443,"spans":444,"direction":92},"Fill in customs information as part of your online booking without needing to print anything extra - we'll do the rest",[],{"dimensions":446,"alt":447,"copyright":46,"url":448,"id":449,"edit":450},{"width":422,"height":422},"Passport icon","peru.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F00399f73-6c8a-4398-a945-07eba83626df_important+documents.svg","Yh96GBIAAC4A-Zsv",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":452,"content":453,"icon":457},"Flexible printing options",[454],{"type":89,"text":455,"spans":456,"direction":92},"Print your parcel labels at home or in-store for FREE",[],{"dimensions":458,"alt":459,"copyright":46,"url":460,"id":461,"edit":462},{"width":422,"height":422},"Printer icon","peru.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":463},"#fff",{"title":465,"content":466,"icon":470},"Bulk send",[467],{"type":89,"text":468,"spans":469,"direction":92},"Book multiple parcels online all at once using our bulk send tool",[],{"dimensions":471,"alt":472,"copyright":46,"url":473,"id":474,"edit":475},{"width":422,"height":422},"Strapped boxes icon","peru.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fb82a1925-5ffc-46c0-8e22-29fd200a2721_strapped+items.svg","Yh96FxIAACoA-ZsU",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"title":477,"content":478,"icon":482},"Trusted by top UK brands",[479],{"type":89,"text":480,"spans":481,"direction":92},"We're trusted to deliver for many of the UK's biggest retailers like ASOS, Boohoo, Gymshark, House of Fraser, Lonsdale and Lookfantastic, just to name a few",[],{"dimensions":483,"alt":484,"copyright":46,"url":485,"id":486,"edit":487},{"width":422,"height":422},"Success icon","peru.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"theme":489,"title":490,"description":46},"standard","Why send internationally with Evri?","list_block$5561303f-d955-4b8d-a3c8-2302fd07d450","list_block",{"variation":182,"version":31,"items":494,"primary":496,"id":509,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":46},[495],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":497,"CardText":498,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":508,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Peru",[499],{"type":89,"text":500,"spans":501,"direction":92},"Our channels are open to a great variety of items; however there are a few things that you can’t send internationally with Evri. Check out a comprehensive list of what you can and can’t send to make sure your items are safe for transit. ",[502,507],{"start":503,"end":504,"type":102,"data":505},163,190,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":506},"_self",{"start":503,"end":504,"type":99},{"link_type":166},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":182,"version":31,"items":511,"primary":513,"id":565,"slice_type":126,"slice_label":46},[512],{},{"CardAvatar":85,"CardTitle":514,"CardText":515,"ButtonText":45,"ButtonUrl":563,"IsEco":20},"How to format an address when sending to Peru",[516,519,522,525,528,531,534,537,541,546,551,556,560],{"type":89,"text":517,"spans":518,"direction":92},"When you send a parcel to Peru, you’ll need to follow the correct address structure: ",[],{"type":192,"text":520,"spans":521,"direction":92},"The recipient’s name ",[],{"type":192,"text":523,"spans":524,"direction":92},"The street name and house\u002Fbuilding number ",[],{"type":192,"text":526,"spans":527,"direction":92},"The postcode ",[],{"type":192,"text":529,"spans":530,"direction":92},"The city ",[],{"type":192,"text":532,"spans":533,"direction":92},"PERU in capital letters on the last line of the address ",[],{"type":89,"text":535,"spans":536,"direction":92},"For example: ",[],{"type":89,"text":538,"spans":539,"direction":92},"Mr  J. Bloggs ",[540],{"start":66,"end":263,"type":99},{"type":89,"text":542,"spans":543,"direction":92},"Av. Larco 1234, Miraflores ",[544],{"start":66,"end":545,"type":99},26,{"type":89,"text":547,"spans":548,"direction":92},"15074 ",[549],{"start":66,"end":550,"type":99},5,{"type":89,"text":552,"spans":553,"direction":92},"LIMA ",[554],{"start":66,"end":555,"type":99},4,{"type":89,"text":557,"spans":558,"direction":92},"PERU ",[559],{"start":66,"end":555,"type":99},{"type":89,"text":561,"spans":562,"direction":92},"But don’t worry, just enter the correct address information at checkout, and we’ll ensure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label. ",[],{"link_type":36,"key":564,"url":164},"e883c23c-2067-4b01-921e-7be469f61f22","card$01a6a053-7981-4f82-bc6b-1ba7078276c6",{"variation":128,"version":31,"items":567,"primary":604,"id":606,"slice_type":607,"slice_label":46},[568,574,587],{"questionTitle":569,"questionBody":570},"How long does it take to send a parcel to Peru?",[571],{"type":89,"text":572,"spans":573,"direction":92},"A parcel to Peru, once dropped off at a ParcelShop or Locker, should take around 18-21 days to arrive at its destination. ",[],{"questionTitle":575,"questionBody":576},"Can I track my parcels to Peru?",[577],{"type":89,"text":578,"spans":579,"direction":92},"Absolutely. We offer end-to-end tracking on all our parcels for no additional cost. Simply input your tracking number on our international tracking page, and you’ll be able to see your parcel’s progress.  ",[580,585],{"start":581,"end":582,"type":102,"data":583},125,152,{"link_type":36,"url":584,"target":418},"peru.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":581,"end":586,"type":99},153,{"questionTitle":588,"questionBody":589},"Are there any import taxes to pay on a parcel from the UK to Peru?",[590,593,596],{"type":89,"text":591,"spans":592,"direction":92},"When sending parcels to Peru, you may need to pay customs fees and taxes. The average import tax on goods entering Peru is 18% but the amount can vary depending on the destination, purpose, and value of your parcel. ",[],{"type":89,"text":594,"spans":595,"direction":92},"If your recipient needs to pay customs duty, remember to let them know. We’ll contact your recipient and share a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items. ",[],{"type":89,"text":597,"spans":598,"direction":92},"Check out our simple guide on how to send an international parcel for more information. ",[599,603],{"start":600,"end":385,"type":102,"data":601},30,{"link_type":36,"url":602,"target":418},"\u002Fguides\u002Fhow-to-send-an-international-parcel",{"start":600,"end":385,"type":99},{"title":605},"Frequently asked questions","frequently_asked_questions$4c469f65-6730-41ff-8952-2d59d83cd157","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,127,175,181,266,341,358,404,493,510,566],["Reactive",610],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":611,"$sclients":677,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":680},{"abtasty":612,"accessibe":615,"appPromoBanner":618,"autoDivertUpdates":621,"awin":624,"bulkInternational":627,"bulkSendEnabled":630,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":633,"enableBasketCount":636,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":639,"euCustomsDuty":642,"groovyAdvert":645,"newInternationalSendFlow":648,"newinternationalpages":655,"oohPreferenceFlag":659,"opentel":662,"premium":665,"savedCards